List all custom models registered in the Azure AI Foundry custom model registry.

Usage
  azd ai models list [flags]

Flags
  -o, --output string           : Output format (table, json) (default "table")
      --project-endpoint string : Azure AI Foundry project endpoint URL (e.g., https://account.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/project-name)
      --source-job-id string    : Filter models by the training job that created them
  -s, --subscription string     : Azure subscription ID

Global Flags
      --debug     : Enable debug mode
  -h, --help      : help for list
      --no-prompt : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.

Examples
  List custom models in the configured project
    azd ai models list
